  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "A podcast host named Jesse Michels tells of two airmen, Mario and Michael, who say they were abducted by aliens in 1977 at Ellsworth Air Force Base in South Dakota. Michels says the worst part was what came afterwards: Air Force interrogators spent most of their time trying to explain the experience away, and the men faced demotions and denial. He tells it because, if true, it would show the military working to bury what its own men reported."
